，測辰拂羽，爰詔六宮，親蠶川室。皇太后降鑾從御，佇蹕觀禮。綠蘧既具，玄紞方脩，庶儀發椒，闈化動中。縣妃主以下，可量加班錫。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":7,"end":9,"surface":"六宮","id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p002:u0007","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"宮中集體。"},{"start":40,"end":42,"surface":"六宮","id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p002:u0040","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"宮中參禮者。"},{"start":81,"end":86,"surface":"縣妃主以下","id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p002:u0081","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"受班錫之命婦。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":237,"last_line":237,"revision_id":2634831,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":8107,"raw_end":8208,"raw_character_offsets":[8112,8113,8114,8115,8118,8119,8120,8121,8122,8123,8124,8125,8126,8127,8128,8129,8130,8131,8132,8133,8134,8135,8136,8137,8138,8139,8140,8141,8142,8143,8144,8145,8146,8147,8148,8149,8150,8151,8152,8153,8154,8155,8156,8157,8158,8159,8160,8161,8162,8163,8164,8165,8166,8167,8168,8169,8170,8171,8172,8173,8174,8175,8176,8177,8178,8179,8180,8181,8182,8183,8184,8185,8186,8187,8188,8189,8190,8191,8192,8193,8194,8195,8196,8197,8198,8199,8200,8201,8202,8203,8204,8205,8206,8207],"projection_sha256":"1888e5e3a91c1f1b6899d5cc2eb4125b90bbfa27ccaf5219353d4bd91dcbbfca"},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family","book_id":"b-songshu-041","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family-ws2634831"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengda","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangsengda-ws1752646","source":{"title":"南史卷二十一·王僧達","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1752646","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1752646","revision_id":1752646,"accessed_on":"2026-11-19","edition":"維基文庫固定修訂1752646，武英殿本書影逐項參記。","extent":"逐讀第41行分題至第57行分